  "contract": "#690 and #802 report these two passives as unimplemented; both are native auras. Boding Dread (804975) has effect 0 aura 79 MOD_DAMAGE_PERCENT_DONE, misc 32 (Shadow), BasePoints 2 DieSides 1 (+3%) and effect 1 aura 71 MOD_SPELL_CRIT_CHANCE_SCHOOL, misc 32 (+3). Fury of Shadra (503850) has effect 0 aura 303 MOD_DAMAGE_DONE_VERSUS_AURASTATE and effect 1 aura 360 ASCENSION_MOD_HEALING_DONE_VERSUS_AURASTATE, both misc 13 = AURA_STATE_HEALTHLESS_35_PERCENT, BasePoints 14 DieSides 1 (+15%); the damage aura is read in Unit::SpellDamageBonusDone, the healing aura in Unit::SpellHealingBonusDone, and the aura state is refreshed in Unit::Update. Every number is measured against the same actor's own baseline: Shadow Bolt (686, school 32) and Fireball (133, school 4) for damage, Flash Heal (2061) for healing, and a below-35% and a full-health target for each. The wait after set_health lets the once-per-tick aura state refresh."
